      "rationale": "Delivery is a legitimate actionable theme. The taffy row is correctly flagged 1, but the peanuts row (no delivery mention; a labeling issue) is flagged 1, a clear misread that undermines reliability."
    },
    {
      "name": "low_score_with_issue",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.8,
