  "analytical_usefulness": 0.68,
  "source_groundedness": 0.7,
  "rationale": "Most added columns give genuine actionable axes (issue/price/delivery mentions, helpfulness weighting, low-score-with-issue) directly relevant to identifying improvement actions; review_length is the weakest, being generic. Groundedness is mixed: helpfulness_ratio and price/satisfaction flags read the source soundly, but the issue- and delivery-detection columns show clear misclassifications in the samples (the 'Not as Advertised' row misses a quality issue and spuriously flags delivery), which propagate into the composite low_score_with_issue column."
